	(text "Gate and Kelvin of each device as coupled pairs of equal length (+/-10 %) from the COM star; Ron, Roff, Kelvin\nR, 10k, Zeners at each device. Clamp FET + C_VL at its device's gate-Kelvin pins, loop <= 1 nH. DESAT string\n>= 2.5 mm pad gap per diode; board coated to PD1 (IC-22). Miller hold (ngspice, gdrv): die +1.41 V vs VGS(th)\nmin 1.94 V at 175 C - BENCH TEST. Driver input side and bias primary decoupled to GND locally (CM current)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 404.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
